      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is incredibly disorienting to feel that the only purpose you have is to survive the immediate next step in the cycle you are in. While this sense of hopelessness about the \"end\" of life can be overwhelming, you do not have to carry the weight of those thoughts alone, and there are people who see you as more than just a \"unit.\" I encourage you to talk to a trusted friend or a support professional so we can help you find a way to break this endless feeling.",
